# .publicsync-ignore — paths that stay in private and never sync to public
#
# Format: rsync --exclude-from syntax. One pattern per line. Trailing slashes
# match directories only; bare names match anywhere in the tree.
#
# Add a path here when:
#   - it's tracked in private (visible in `git status` / git history), AND
#   - it should NOT appear in the public repo (sanitized mirror)
#
# Anything that should NEVER appear in either repo (build artifacts, etc.)
# belongs in .gitignore instead.

